           03  ARIBACAT2-VENDOR-AUXID    PIC X(50)     VALUE SPACE.
           03  ARIBACAT2-VENDOR-PRICE  PIC S9(11)V9999 COMP-3 VALUE +0.
           03  ARIBACAT2-CONVER-PRICE  PIC S9(11)V9999 COMP-3 VALUE +0.
           03  ARIBACAT2-EMPTY-PRICE   PIC S9(11)V9999 COMP-3 VALUE +0.
           03  ARIBACAT2-VENDOR-UM       PIC X(02)     VALUE SPACE.
           03  ARIBACAT2-STOREROOM-UM    PIC X(02)     VALUE SPACE.
           03  ARIBACAT2-QTY-UM          PIC X(02)     VALUE SPACE.
           03  ARIBACAT2-CURR-CODE       PIC X(02)     VALUE SPACE.
           03  ARIBACAT2-HOME-CURR-CODE  PIC X(02)     VALUE SPACE.
           03  ARIBACAT2-PREF-FLAG       PIC X(01)     VALUE SPACE.
           03  ARIBACAT2-OVRD-FLAG       PIC X(01)     VALUE SPACE.
           03  ARIBACAT2-REASON-CODE     PIC X(04)     VALUE SPACE.
           03  ARIBACAT2-DATE-TIME-STMP  PIC X(14)     VALUE SPACE.
           03  FILLER                    PIC X(04)     VALUE SPACE.
